{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/Title_Banner_1.png?t=1750681147\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring your board game cafe to life in the vibrant seaside town of Pebblebrook! Spend your time managing your cafe, completing quests to unlock new items and exploring the town and beyond!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/Title_Banner_2.png?t=1750681147\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Over 100 Food and Drink Items</strong><br>Bake, brew, and create your own personalised cafe menu with a wide variety of seasonal recipes<strong> </strong>to unlock and discover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/Recipes.png?t=1750681147\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Board Game Collection</strong><br>Discover and unlock 100+ board games - match them with menu items to generate special effects in your cafe!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/Boardgames.png?t=1750681147\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grow or Source Ingredients</strong><br>Harvest your own crops or source ingredients from the local market shop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/image_164_0000.jpg?t=1750681147\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Offer Takeaway and Delivery Services</strong><br>Fulfill customer orders outside the cafe and expand your customer reach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engage in Community Quests &amp; Events</strong>\u00a0<br>Help locals, earn rewards, and unlock content by connecting with the town.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customise your cafe</strong><br>Create themed caf\u00e9s paired with board game genres or design your own style (decor items will be added incrementally).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/image_172_0005.jpg?t=1750681147\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore Pebblebrook</strong><br>Discover the vibrant seaside town, meet locals, build friendships, and uncover secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/extras/image_170_0005.jpg?t=1750681147\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3168560?t=1750681147","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/96f7aa7e5d90017609c7642438d72199554c80e3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750681147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/a67f336db5950233f1deeb95161c9ccbbf1249ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750681147","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168560/a67f336db5950233f1deeb95161c9ccbbf1249ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750681147","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akama